Since you did not specify the size of the room or any specific features other than it being a space heater, I have ranked the products based on their general heating capabilities and efficiency. The Dr. Infrared Heater DR-968, known for its powerful and safe warmth, took the first position. The Honeywell 360° Surround Heater follows, appreciated for its reliable and safe performance in small to mid-sized rooms. The Lasko Ceramic Tower Heater, with its oscillation and programmable features, comes third. The Dreo Portable Space Heater warms rooms efficiently and quietly, securing the fourth spot. Lastly, the Pelonis 1500W Electric Oil Radiator Heater, with its adjustable thermostat and programmable timer, rounds up the list.

The Dyson Purifier Hot+Cool Formaldehyde and the Heat Storm Tradesman 1500W Infrared Heater are not suitable for traditional space heating as they have additional purposes such as air purification and portable, outdoor heating respectively. However, they might still be relevant if you are considering combining space heating with air quality improvement or outdoor space heating.
